285
00:12:19,864 --> 00:12:21,282
I think...

286
00:12:21,324 --> 00:12:23,784
I think I can see your scalp.

287
00:12:23,826 --> 00:12:25,828
Don't you just love it?

288
00:12:25,870 --> 00:12:27,121
Y-Yeah, yeah.

289
00:12:27,163 --> 00:12:29,290
Y-You got shellfish
in your head.

290
00:12:30,875 --> 00:12:32,627
It's, uh... it's something.

291
00:12:32,669 --> 00:12:34,170
You go, girlfriend!

292
00:12:34,212 --> 00:12:37,090
You've never said that
in your life, have you?

293
00:12:37,131 --> 00:12:39,050
Not once.
I thought so.

294
00:12:39,092 --> 00:12:40,843
Oh! And listen to this.

295
00:12:40,885 --> 00:12:44,639
