298
00:13:00,821 --> 00:13:02,574
Ooh!

299
00:13:02,616 --> 00:13:04,534
Wow, it's, uh...
kind of weird.

300
00:13:04,576 --> 00:13:07,454
I'm sitting next to
Charlie after we broke up.

301
00:13:07,495 --> 00:13:09,456
Yeah, it's almost
as if Air Barbados

302
00:13:09,497 --> 00:13:11,499
