with Charlie.

307
00:13:18,381 --> 00:13:19,507
I understand.

308
00:13:19,549 --> 00:13:20,634
No, I'll do it.

309
00:13:21,968 --> 00:13:23,511
Wish I could switch
with someone.

310
00:13:23,553 --> 00:13:25,930
I really don't want to sit
with Allen Iverson over there.

311
00:13:31,352 --> 00:13:33,480
Um, you know,
once we're in the air,

312
00:13:33,521 --> 00:13:36,232
and the captain turns off
the seat-belt sign,

313
00:13:36,274 --> 00:13:38,485
you feel free
to roam about my cabin.

314
00:13:39,778 --> 00:13:41,195
You should be careful

315
00:13:41,237 --> 00:13:43,531
when checking
your overhead bins...

316
00:13:43,573 --> 00:13:45,742
'cause items may shift during...

317
00:13:45,784 --> 00:13:47,535
Aw, you're not good at this.

318
00:13:50,413 --> 00:13:52,624
Hey, you don't have to go home
tonight, do you?

319
00:13:52,666 --> 00:13:55,418
No, I think I could come over.
It's Saturday, right?

320
00:13:55,460 --> 00:13:56,795
Oh...

321
00:13:56,835 --> 00:13:58,463
