324
00:14:02,425 --> 00:14:03,926
I have a date.

325
00:14:03,968 --> 00:14:05,470
You have a...

326
00:14:05,512 --> 00:14:07,096
You have a date?

327
00:14:07,138 --> 00:14:08,389
