341
00:14:33,164 --> 00:14:34,248
I promise.

342
00:14:34,290 --> 00:14:37,377
Oh, okay, good.
You do that.

343
00:14:37,418 --> 00:14:39,962
And then when you get home,
maybe there'll be

344
00:14:40,004 --> 00:14:42,423
