good time to talk to him.

359
00:15:15,874 --> 00:15:17,124
Well, I guess so.

360
00:15:17,166 --> 00:15:19,210
I'm just... really nervous.

361
00:15:19,252 --> 00:15:21,838
Okay, well, keep in mind
that by the time you're done,

362
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:23,548
