be serving dinner.

363
00:15:23,590 --> 00:15:25,425
Ooh.

364
00:15:26,676 --> 00:15:28,928
Still nervous?

365
00:15:28,969 --> 00:15:30,971
I'm gonna get the lasagna.

366
00:15:31,972 --> 00:15:32,931
Hey, Rach?

367
00:15:32,973 --> 00:15:34,350
Yeah?

368
00:15:34,392 --> 00:15:35,935
Do you mind if I
sit here for a sec?

369
00:15:35,976 --> 00:15:37,604
Yeah. Yeah. Oh, sure!

370
00:15:37,645 --> 00:15:39,355
Yeah.

371
00:15:42,567 --> 00:15:44,151
( sighs )

372
00:15:44,193 --> 00:15:45,152
Hey.

373
00:15:45,194 --> 00:15:47,029
Hey.

374
00:15:47,071 --> 00:15:48,989
So, I, um...

375
00:15:49,031 --> 00:15:51,242
I kinda need to talk
