387
00:16:21,898 --> 00:16:23,566
But... nothing else,

388
00:16:23,608 --> 00:16:25,984
nothing else
happened, okay?

389
00:16:26,026 --> 00:16:27,069
Ross, Ross...

390
00:16:27,111 --> 00:16:28,321
It's okay.

391
00:16:28,362 --> 00:16:29,405
What?

392
00:16:29,447 --> 00:16:30,949
It's okay.

393
00:16:30,990 --> 00:16:34,410
Look, I totally understand,
all right?

394
00:16:34,452 --> 00:16:36,996
You guys make way more sense

395
00:16:37,037 --> 00:16:39,916
than her and I ever did,
you know, and...

396
00:16:39,958 --> 00:16:41,584
I want you to be happy.

397
00:16:41,626 --> 00:16:43,544
Are you serious?

398
00:16:43,586 --> 00:16:45,379
Yeah.

399
00:16:47,381 --> 00:16:49,133
Now, I have something...

400
00:16:49,175 --> 00:16:51,302
I am speechless.

401
00:16:52,637 --> 00:16:54,221
I mean, the fact

402
00:16:54,263 --> 00:16:56,516
