friend, you know that?

405
00:16:59,978 --> 00:17:01,771
Well, look, before you go...

406
00:17:01,813 --> 00:17:02,814
No, I-I mean it.

407
00:17:02,856 --> 00:17:04,524
I mean, you are so...

408
00:17:04,565 --> 00:17:07,610
