Thanks.

419
00:17:36,723 --> 00:17:37,849
Yeah.

420
00:17:42,144 --> 00:17:43,103
So, hi.

421
00:17:43,145 --> 00:17:44,438
Hi.

422
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:45,982
So, you, uh, so,
you talked to Joey?

423
00:17:46,024 --> 00:17:47,107
Oh, yeah.

424
00:17:47,149 --> 00:17:48,401
We had a really good talk.

425
00:17:48,442 --> 00:17:49,402
Oh, that's great.

426
00:17:49,443 --> 00:17:50,444
Yeah.

427
00:17:50,486 --> 00:17:51,612
Oh, so, everything's okay?

428
00:17:51,654 --> 00:17:54,240
Oh, no, it's great.
It's great.

429
00:17:54,281 --> 00:17:56,034
He's an amazing guy.

430
00:17:56,075 --> 00:17:58,953
Ah, well, obviously,
I think so, too.

431
00:17:58,995 --> 00:18:02,206
Well, I am
so excited about this.

432
00:18:02,248 --> 00:18:05,043
Really?

433
00:18:05,084 --> 00:18:06,085
Excited?

434
00:18:06,126 --> 00:18:08,170
Are you kidding?

435
00:18:08,212 --> 00:18:12,341
I have had some very
dirty dreams about this.

436
00:18:15,261 --> 00:18:16,679
Excuse me.

437
00:18:23,436 --> 00:18:25,438
You didn't tell
him, did you?

438
00:18:25,479 --> 00:18:26,940
I couldn't.

439
00:18:26,981 --> 00:18:29,067
He was saying all these
really nice things about me.

440
00:18:29,108 --> 00:18:31,318
I didn't want him to get mad
and take them all back.

441
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:32,612
I'm gonna edge out Chandler.

442
00:18:32,653 --> 00:18:33,863
Oh, God!

443
00:18:33,905 --> 00:18:35,489
All right, fine.
You know what, Joey?

444
00:18:35,531 --> 00:18:37,283
Forget it. When we
go back to New York,

445
00:18:37,324 --> 00:18:38,618
