Thank you.

446
00:18:38,659 --> 00:18:40,787
Yeah, I appreciate that.

447
00:18:40,828 --> 00:18:43,790
Ha-ha-ha-ho-ho!

448
00:18:46,500 --> 00:18:48,086
Ho-ho...

449
