451
00:19:00,222 --> 00:19:01,390
Hey, it's Mike.

452
00:19:01,432 --> 00:19:02,558
Ooh, that was fast.

453
00:19:02,600 --> 00:19:04,268
Oh, no, she's not here yet.

454
00:19:04,310 --> 00:19:06,771
You know, I think
I'm just going to take off

455
00:19:06,813 --> 00:19:08,856
