474
00:19:58,823 --> 00:19:59,866
Phoebe?

475
00:19:59,907 --> 00:20:01,659
Mike's ex-girlfriend
Phoebe?

476
00:20:01,701 --> 00:20:02,827
The love of his life?

477
00:20:02,869 --> 00:20:04,037
That Phoebe?

478
00:20:05,287 --> 00:20:06,664
Enchantée.

479
00:20:09,709 --> 00:20:13,004
Oh, I can't wait for
everyone at work to see these.

480
00:20:13,046 --> 00:20:14,338
Ow!

481
00:20:14,380 --> 00:20:16,966
You go back to work
tomorrow night, right?

482
00:20:17,008 --> 00:20:18,134
Yeah.

483
00:20:18,176 --> 00:20:19,760
So, if you want people
to see them,

484
00:20:19,802 --> 00:20:22,221
