501
00:21:03,888 --> 00:21:04,931
Did I?

502
00:21:04,972 --> 00:21:06,473
Let's refresh.

503
00:21:06,515 --> 00:21:09,102
I believe what I said was
that I could see your scalp.

504
00:21:09,143 --> 00:21:11,729
Well, fine, so you
don't like them.

505
00:21:11,771 --> 00:21:13,272
Everybody else does.

506
00:21:13,313 --> 00:21:15,900
Again,
let's journey back.

507
00:21:15,942 --> 00:21:17,902
As I recall,

508
00:21:17,944 --> 00:21:20,154
what Rachel said was,
she had never noticed

509
00:21:20,196 --> 00:21:21,781
