of your skull before.

510
00:21:21,822 --> 00:21:23,699
And Joey...

511
00:21:23,741 --> 00:21:26,410
Well, Joey didn't realize
there was anything different.

512
00:21:26,452 --> 00:21:28,662
Well, you know what,
I don't care.

513
00:21:28,704 --> 00:21:30,831
I like it like this
and I'm going to keep it.

514
00:21:30,873 --> 00:21:33,500
You're just jealous because
your hair can't do this.

515
00:21:34,919 --> 00:21:37,130
Ow!

516
00:21:37,171 --> 00:21:38,923
