522
00:21:52,478 --> 00:21:55,189
Oh, my God, I missed you.

523
00:21:55,231 --> 00:21:57,150
Oh, Emma, I missed you so much.

524
00:21:57,191 --> 00:21:58,734
Hi.

525
00:21:58,776 --> 00:22:00,736
Did you have a good time
with Grandma Green, huh?

526
00:22:00,778 --> 00:22:04,031
