528
00:22:07,118 --> 00:22:08,744
That was one time, Ross,

529
00:22:08,786 --> 00:22:10,621
and they were only, like,
five milligrams.

530
00:22:10,663 --> 00:22:14,332
Ooh, hey, Emma, Daddy
