531
00:22:14,374 --> 00:22:16,961
Okay, okay, I want you
to wait right here.

532
00:22:17,003 --> 00:22:19,005
Come here, sweetie.

533
00:22:19,046 --> 00:22:22,424
Ross, um, actually there's
something that, uh,

534
00:22:22,466 --> 00:22:24,468
